The project's conventions, stack and database rules are in **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)**, the
single source of truth shared by all tools. Read it before work and keep to it.

Supporting documents:
- `DECISIONS.md`: architecture decisions (D-0xx) with context; every feature has a record
- `SCHEMA.md`: database schema (§5 = IFC mapping and declared extensions)
- `ROADMAP.md`: phases, sprints and priorities
- `etl/README.md`: running the ETL pipeline

Do not change conventions in this file; edit `AGENTS.md`. This is only a pointer.
